==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use rushers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] to quickly beat the stage.

